sentences.text:
Applicant shall also abide by the following conditions:
i. that the applicant shall not, directly or indirectly, make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case, so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any Police Officer;
ii. that the applicant shall not act, in any manner, which will be prejudicial to fair and expeditious trial.

